---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Install — aicqtools" locale="en">
  <h1>Install guide</h1>

  <h2>1. Install the CLI</h2>
  <pre><code>{`pnpm add -D @aicqtools/cli
# or
npm i -D @aicqtools/cli`}</code></pre>

  <h2>2. pre-commit hook (husky)</h2>
  <pre><code>{`pnpm add -D husky
pnpm exec husky init
echo 'npx aicq check' > .husky/pre-commit`}</code></pre>

  <h2>3. GitHub Action</h2>
  <p><code>.github/workflows/aicq-check.yml</code>:</p>
  <pre><code>{`name: AICQ check
on: [pull_request, push]
jobs:
  check:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: aicqtools/aicqtools/packages/action@main
        with:
          locale: en`}</code></pre>

  <h2>4. Register the MCP server (Claude Code)</h2>
  <pre><code>{`claude mcp add --transport stdio aicq -- npx -y @aicqtools/cli mcp`}</code></pre>
  <p>After restarting Claude Code, rule violations are blocked at prompt time.</p>
</Layout>
